Breakpoint	Behavior
Default / mobile
Nav height 64px, padding-x 24px. Hamburger only (no Navigate pill, no flower). Hero padding-bottom 64px. H1 2.5rem / line-height 0.95, no forced H1 break. Subcopy text-base, CTA text-sm. Overlay links text-4xl.
